        "text": "Title VII establishes liability when a protected characteristic was a motivating factor, even if other factors also motivated the practice."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Irving L. Gornstein",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9717679c0c4b7d134334283034feedb180e21ceea4822f034c26dcd822c7ebac",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9717679c0c4b-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 17,
              "start": 17
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Irving L. Gornstein, the 1991 amendments created a special rule for mixed\u2011motive cases where proof of but\u2011for cause is not required."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9717679c0c4b7d134334283034feedb180e21ceea4822f034c26dcd822c7ebac",
            "evidence_ids": [
