            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice, the Court asked: \u201cWhat is your definition of direct evidence?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9717679c0c4b7d134334283034feedb180e21ceea4822f034c26dcd822c7ebac",
            "evidence_ids": [
